            <ArticleTitle>Coronary stenting through 6 French guiding catheters.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>263-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Most stent implantation procedures currently require the use of large-diameter guiding catheters. We describe our preliminary successful experience with 6 French guiding catheters to deliver balloon-expandable Palmaz-Schatz stents to the coronary arteries.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
